Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,《小鬼当家3》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,(香港)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.84,0:01:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有顾客出一千万买导弹芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten million dollars for the missile chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不是计划..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a plan..
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.81,0:01:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是真正的芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..but the chip itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,为何出那么高价?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the big price?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的顾客肯出钱买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My clients have requested it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.39,0:01:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我便照客户的吩咐去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I honor my clients' requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你的客户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like your clients..
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,想制造雷达探测不到的导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..want to build a missile that can't be detected by radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不问顾客作何用途,博普雷先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't ask questions, Mr.Beaupre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过谁拥有这芯片,就能控制整个地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But whoever possesses this chip could dominate the entire region.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,(AXUS国防科技公司)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,(加州 硅谷)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.59,0:01:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 晚安,乔治 - 晚安,库珀先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night, George. - Good night, Mr.Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没武器 - 给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's clean. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.27,0:02:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你要的货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,空军NSB-100,C系列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air Force NSB-100, C series.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只要装在导弹上,空中防御系统便无法抵御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that goes in a missile, air defenses can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,听着,我要赶飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I got a plane to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的钱呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,藏在玩具车内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide it in the toy car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以通过机场安检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll slip it right past airport security.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.64,0:03:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎到旧金山国际机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to San Francisco International Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请小心保管行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not leave your bags unattended.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,请将首饰取下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please remove your jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,女士,你得等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, you have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.99,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,下一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,(离境航班资料)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,让开.让开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.71,0:05:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我查过达拉斯,迈阿密,纽约和丹佛候机室,找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dallas, Miami, New York and Denver lounges. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,酒吧,餐厅,俱乐部都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bars, restaurants, club lounge, clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was in the john, I didn't see anything in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一定在飞机上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to be on a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,(登机)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:06:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,(芝加哥)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去芝加哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going to Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,冬天去那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了夏天衣物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I packed tropical.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临芝加哥,室外气温华氏29度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Chicago, where it's 29 degrees outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临芝加哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,来,先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,博普雷先生!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Beaupre!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,昂格尔先生,杰尼根先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Unger, Mr.Jernigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,借过..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 借过 - 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Out of my way. - Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有行李吗,女士? - 没有,快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you check any bags, ma'am? - No. Floor it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.25,0:07:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起,老伯.我能问你件事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, pop. Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,1月8日下午4点20分,你从机场接了一位客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a fare from the airport around 16:20 hours, January 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是一位白人老太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senior citizen, female, Caucasian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 今天大约4点30,载了老太婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - About 4:30 today. Old broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦,对 - 你记得地址吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yeah. - You got an address on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,北丹佛公园,华盛顿街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}North Devon Park, Washington Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,请形容一下房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Describe the house, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.61,0:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,宏伟,古老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big, old..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,中古型房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Tudor-like place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 详细一点 - 有圣诞灯,门上有彩环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Details. - Christmas lights, wreath on the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,车道尾有圣诞树,那个车道..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christmas tree by the driveway, and the driveway..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个街区唯一没铲雪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..was the only one on the block not shoveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我做完了,赫斯太太.我又热又累..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done, Mrs.Hess. I'm exhausted and sweaty..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,..但因为我衣服太厚你看不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..but you can't see because I'm covered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.61,0:08:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你应及时清雪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were to deal with the snow promptly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的,不过.. - 不用找借口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, but.. - "Buts" are for ashtrays.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想听借口.我们早就说好了,你没守约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care for excuses. We had an understanding and you broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的话不可信 - 对不起,这次免费吧,赫斯太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your word is worthless. - Sorry. That'll be no charge, Mrs.Hess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你好告诉邻居我占你便宜?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can tell the neighbors I stiffed you on a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是旧金山著名的酸面包?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a loaf of the famous San Francisco sourdough bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这不能做很好吃的三明治,是吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This won't make a very tasty sandwich, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有个莽撞的笨蛋拿了我的袋子..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of some silly, inconsiderate boob who took my bag..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,使我的面包留在旧金山!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..I left my bread in San Francisco!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起,赫斯太太,但我想我差不多,可能..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pardon me, Mrs.Hess, but I think I'm almost, maybe..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也许,也许会赶不及吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..possibly, probably gonna be late for my dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去当作酬劳,我没有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider this your payment. I have no use for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你母亲有没有教你..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And have your mother teach you..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在女士面前抓痒是不礼貌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..that it is rude to scratch yourself in front of a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:10:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安,艾历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哎..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a grouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都是旧房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all old..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,大多是中古型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..most of them are Tudor..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.45,0:10:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,门口都有花圈与圣诞树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..all have wreaths and Christmas trees..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,雪都铲走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..and the snow's all shoveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,共有14户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are 14 houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.73,0:10:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具车一定在其中一家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The toy car must be in one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要全部搜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to search them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们白天再来 - 我们大白天偷入屋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll come back when it's light. - We're gonna work in daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是郊区,昂格尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the suburbs, Mr.Unger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,白天没人在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's home during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,(艾历克斯·普鲁伊特科学展览室)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吧,小飞鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go, Speedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,查理,我去年就告诉过你,我现在再告诉你..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, I told you last year, and I'm telling you now..
