Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是这里 - 真希望我丈夫今天能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here we are. - I wish my husband could be here.
