Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.93,0:20:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我是小孩子也知道白天有机可乘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm 8 and I figured that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那些成年窃贼想不到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't a grown-up crook figure it out too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这社区很安全,只有一条路出入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a very safe neighborhood. There's only one road in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我会锁门,你有我的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doors'll be locked, you have my numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我尽快回来 - 可是,妈妈!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be home soon. - But, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.81,0:20:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要是恐龙,巨型蜘蛛,木乃伊,僵尸..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about dragons, giant spiders, mummies, the living dead..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他东西出来呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..and other figments of my imagination?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,艾历克斯,我帮不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, I can't help you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你能控制幻觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only you can control your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,自己吓自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a scary thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.77,0:22:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.91,0:22:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.52,0:22:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,20秒后出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20 seconds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.83,0:23:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,报案电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}911 Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我看见一个窃贼! - 你一人在家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I saw a burglar! - Are you by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈要出门一下,我长水痘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom had to leave. I have the chickenpox.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.94,0:23:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你地址是哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I have your address?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,窃贼不在我家!是在史蒂芬斯家!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not at my house! He's at the Stephans'!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.31,0:23:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们地址是华盛顿街3015号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their address is 3015 Washington Street!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.08,0:23:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.41,0:24:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,史蒂芬斯家有盗贼!我用望远镜看到的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burglar at the Stephans'! I saw him with my telescope!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.84,0:24:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有个带着狗的女人,灰色货车,还有穿运动装的男人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a woman with a dog and a gray van, and a man in running clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.18,0:24:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我只认得那只狗,像是强尼·艾伦的狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't recognize anyone, but the dog looked like Johnny Allen's..
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.12,0:24:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我了报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..so I called the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.88,0:24:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你报警了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You called the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.11,0:24:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,冻死了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,防盗警铃开了,没有坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The burglar alarm was on and working.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.83,0:25:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,屋子里面没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no one in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.80,0:25:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好像没有什么东西被偷走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't appear that anything's been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.40,0:25:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他看见什么,但屋里没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what he saw but it wasn't a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.01,0:25:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.67,0:25:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子长水痘,我必须去上班,拿些文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son's been home with chickenpox and I had to run to work to pick up some papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.08,0:25:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,情非得已,我通常不会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm strapped. I don't normally do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.65,0:25:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子,报假案不是闹着玩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son, false alarms are no joking matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.09,0:25:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不是报假案!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't a false alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.42,0:25:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,屋里那贼人有两人在外把风,还有辆灰色的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy in the house had two lookouts and a driver in a gray van.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.82,0:25:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他有点发烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been running a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.19,0:25:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,教他报警是严重的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ours is a serious business.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.86,0:25:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,他知道,我们圣诞节送他警察玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he knows. We gave him a police set for Christmas..
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.70,0:25:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不是今年,是去年.你知道,警徽,警帽,警笛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this one, but last. You know, one with a badge, a hat and a whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.20,0:26:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他很认真,还在屋内捉人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took it very seriously. He arrested relatives for various crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.81,0:26:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是重罪,没放回厕板或打鼾..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not real crimes, but for leaving the toilet seat up and snoring and..
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.48,0:26:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.98,0:26:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我会教他,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will, yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.82,0:26:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.13,0:26:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你上床去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get in that bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.73,0:26:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起,我看到有人在凯伦·史蒂芬斯的卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, I saw a man in Karen Stephans' bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.70,0:26:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,白种男性,比爸爸大一点,戴检查屁股的手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A white male a little older than Dad, wearing butt inspection gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我早警告你别看望远镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned you about that telescope.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.24,0:26:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看久了会产生幻觉,不管是不是有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look long enough and you'll see things, whether or not they're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.38,0:26:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要到35岁后才有人相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you have to be 35 before anyone listens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.71,0:26:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别耍小聪明,艾历克斯.就算你生病,我还是很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get smart with me, Alex. Sick or not, I'm very angry with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.89,0:26:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天搞很多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You caused a lot of trouble today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.25,0:26:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸和我得去修史蒂芬斯家的门.你觉得这样我们很高兴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad and I have to replace a door at Stephans'. You think we're happy about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.82,0:26:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.73,0:27:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得·博普雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter Beaupre..
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.20,0:27:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,厄尔·昂格尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Earl Unger..
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.91,0:27:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,伯顿·杰尼根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Burton Jernigan..
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.91,0:27:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝·里文斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..and Alice Rivens.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.51,0:27:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们用化名但没上香港的班机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were ticketed under aliases but didn't board the Hong Kong flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信他们还在美国,除此之外,一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe they're still in the U.S., but beyond that, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.52,0:27:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen..
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.59,0:27:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须找回那芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..we've got to find that chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,警铃有什么问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What went wrong with the burglar alarm?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.53,0:27:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没什么,不是因为警铃 - 那谁会报警?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing. It wasn't the alarm. - Then who called the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.03,0:27:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,杰尼根先生,你猜呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Jernigan, care to speculate?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.80,0:27:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有车经过,邮差来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cars came and went. The mailman came by.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.74,0:27:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都可能有人看见,可能是任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could have a watcher on any house. It could be anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.11,0:27:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不是普通人,一定是住这条街的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it's just anybody. I think it's someone on our street.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.65,0:27:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,某个我们没注意到的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone we are not tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.99,0:27:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遗漏的对象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone we've missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.76,0:28:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸,计程车来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, cab's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.93,0:28:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.40,0:28:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈还没回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom's not back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.14,0:28:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,呃,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.61,0:28:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈拿文件去银行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom took some documents to the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.98,0:28:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她不会去很久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can't be gone more than a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.51,0:28:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,赫斯太太在家,你别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs.Hess is home. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.91,0:28:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我的传呼号码快拨键电话上有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My beeper's on speed dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.82,0:28:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 2键,妈妈在1键 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Second button. Mom's is the first. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.79,0:28:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那,你没事? - 绝对没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, you're okay? - Positively.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.52,0:28:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,亲我一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.96,0:28:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.53,0:28:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这社区很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a safe neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.97,0:28:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,警察很能干,你昨天见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have great police, as you learned yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.97,0:28:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不会发生什么事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing bad will happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.27,0:28:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸? - 怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.84,0:28:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 机票拿了? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got your tickets? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.54,0:28:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱包呢? - 在我口袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got your wallet? - It's in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.38,0:28:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你的口袋在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.42,0:29:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 再见,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Bye, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.08,0:29:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,她出门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.61,0:29:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,3025号没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3025 is all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.78,0:30:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,红色箱式车往南行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red sedan heading south.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.75,0:30:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,转右,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turning right. Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.22,0:30:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你及时赶上,普鲁伊特先生 - 等等,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are just in time, Mr.Pruitt. - Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.89,0:30:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.83,0:30:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.15,0:31:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃行动.放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abort. Abort.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.01,0:31:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,撤离,我来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evacuate the area. I'm way my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.04,0:31:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.48,0:31:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快!快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.56,0:31:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.66,0:31:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,检查后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.54,0:32:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.04,0:32:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去楼上看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's check upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.58,0:32:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,贼在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the burglar?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.38,0:32:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没有贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.22,0:32:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只是生病在家的小孩报假案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a kid home sick from school, making false alarms.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.32,0:32:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.20,0:32:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你两天内第二次报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the second time in two days that you've called the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.60,0:32:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,报警是很严重的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a very serious matter when a person calls the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.54,0:32:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天看到有贼,今天又看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw a burglar yesterday, and I saw one today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.91,0:32:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,艾历克斯,听警官说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, listen to the chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.51,0:32:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那屋里没人 - 强尼·艾伦的狗呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There was no one in that house. - What about Johnny Allen's dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.35,0:32:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨晚问过强尼.他的狗周一早上被绑架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I talked to Johnny last night. His dog was kidnapped Monday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.89,0:32:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他看见了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he see it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.79,0:33:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,艾历克斯,快道歉,然后回你房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, apologize to the chief and go up to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.70,0:33:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,做好市民也要挨骂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me for being a good citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.40,0:33:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,艾历克斯!很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex! I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.97,0:33:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不会再发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will not happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.04,0:33:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗,亲爱的?真的,我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will it, honey? Really, I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.97,0:33:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是不准他报警..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wouldn't want to discourage him from calling us..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.28,0:33:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,而是真的有事时才报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..in the event that something real ever does happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.42,0:33:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.78,0:33:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up. - Make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.22,0:33:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你已烦了警察两次,留下记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pranked them twice. It's on your permanent record.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.26,0:33:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,以后你一辈子,如果你报警求助,警察也不会来救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your whole life, if you call for help, it won't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.76,0:33:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸错过了飞机 - 他跟他老板开会迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad missed his plane. - He was late to meet his boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.33,0:33:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还要付血汗钱给史蒂芬斯家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to give family cash to the Stephans..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.90,0:33:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,给那个邪恶老人去修他们的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..and to an evil octogenarian to repair their doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.80,0:33:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,更糟的是..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even worse..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.67,0:33:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们成为大笑柄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.51,0:33:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你让全家丢脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've stained the family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.62,0:34:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,先是史蒂芬斯家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First the Stephans.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.19,0:34:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后到赫斯太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Mrs.Hess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.75,0:34:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意,多丽丝.下个就是奥尔考茨家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree, Doris. The next stop is the Alcotts' house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.09,0:34:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,进屋不偷东西,究竟是什么贼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What burglar goes into a house and doesn't take anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.86,0:34:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么想吗?他们一定在找什么特别的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I think? They're looking for something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.63,0:34:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们去每家找因为他们不知道在谁家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they're looking in every house because they don't know who has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.87,0:34:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is..
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.87,0:34:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在找什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.22,0:34:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没人设法阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If nobody's gonna do anything about this..
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.56,0:34:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我只好靠自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..I'll just have to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.48,0:35:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉,我还没睡醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so sorry. I'm clearly not awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.41,0:35:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.15,0:35:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,开心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.98,0:35:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.87,0:36:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,留心看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.15,0:37:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看,多丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Doris.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.30,0:37:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘了有楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot about the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.25,0:38:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是他了,多丽丝,是他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him, Doris. Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.72,0:38:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对,对,对!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.39,0:38:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要捉到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.97,0:38:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.87,0:38:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具车.在拍摄我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The toy car. It's videotaping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.74,0:38:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.39,0:39:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊!快!快!快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.06,0:39:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别打转!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.82,0:39:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,喂,你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你待我不错,我没必要杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You was friendly. I don't have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.19,0:39:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那笔钱不属于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got money that doesn't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.88,0:39:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你退后.不关你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you back off. Not your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.68,0:40:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你好,我是凯伦.嗨,怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, this is Karen. Hi, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.69,0:40:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我回办公室又迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm running late for the office again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.29,0:40:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得蓝筹股价太高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think blue chips are overvalued.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.80,0:40:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,科枝股不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technology stocks are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.86,0:40:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我在洗澡,能待会儿打给你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in the shower. Can I call you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.04,0:40:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"坏,坏勒罗伊·布朗"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad, bad Leroy Brown
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.87,0:40:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"全城最坏的猫"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baddest cat in the whole damn town
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.01,0:40:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"坏过老金刚"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Badder than old King Kong
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.08,0:40:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"贱过丧家犬"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meaner than a junkyard dog
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.25,0:40:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,加油,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.39,0:40:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,再见!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.07,0:41:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,车在外面,屋内有女人.快过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The car's outside. I got the woman here. Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.22,0:41:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,快点,起来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.33,0:41:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都在赶时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody's in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.63,0:42:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是摄像机.有人在监视我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a camera. Someone's onto us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.50,0:42:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样?芯片在车上,我们45分钟后到机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think it matters? Chip's in the car. We're at the airport in 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.23,0:42:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.24,0:42:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.54,0:42:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,屋内有女人.我去解决她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a woman in the house. I'll deal with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.58,0:42:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拿芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.06,0:42:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我去追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.44,0:42:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.74,0:42:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,能跟你谈谈吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have a word with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.41,0:42:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,别进来,我没穿衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't come in. I'm naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.58,0:42:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你打什么主意,猴子屁股?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on your mind, monkey butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.45,0:42:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.03,0:43:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么臭味?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that funky smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.27,0:43:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,车子不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.53,0:43:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.14,0:43:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快点,快,快,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.78,0:43:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,超出了摇控范围!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's out of range!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.79,0:43:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.18,0:43:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.25,0:44:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.00,0:44:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,杰尼根,往哪个方向?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jernigan, which direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.87,0:44:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,刚经过,往南方朝亚当斯街去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It got past me. It's heading south on Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.51,0:44:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我紧追其后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm right behind the little..
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.78,0:44:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,离开马路,穿过后院..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's off the street, going through back yards..
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.72,0:44:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,往西走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..heading west.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.85,0:44:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝,你在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice, what's your position?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.69,0:44:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,第四间屋,正向小巷走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fourth house. Moving to the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.67,0:45:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.94,0:45:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,穿过篱笆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going through the hedge.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.58,0:45:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,杰尼根,车在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jernigan, position.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.28,0:45:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在你那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.00,0:45:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到了! - 看到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got it! - I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.30,0:45:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,昂格尔.你在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unger. What's your position?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.30,0:45:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,往华盛顿街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heading down Washington Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.07,0:45:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我没听到,哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't copy. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.14,0:45:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我说..我朝华..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, I'm heading to Wa..
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.84,0:45:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,停车,你个笨蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, you nitwit!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.01,0:46:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,车不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.46,0:46:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.06,0:46:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还没找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.83,0:46:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间了,放弃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're out of time. Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.76,0:47:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拿了录影带,为什么还追玩具车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got the tape. Why'd they still chase the toy car?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.60,0:47:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,车又不贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.97,0:47:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定没时间没空玩遥控车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure they don't have enough time to play with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.92,0:48:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,(美国空军招聘中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.40,0:48:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,看,多丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Doris.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.29,0:48:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,(空军募兵处)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.27,0:48:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑芯片?你在哪里找到的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer chip, huh? Where'd you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.01,0:48:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在遥控车里,赫斯太太送我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a remote-control car I got for shoveling snow for Mrs.Hess.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.24,0:48:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她住在对面街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She lives across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.18,0:48:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,上面写着美国空军..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says U.S. Air Force..
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.85,0:48:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但你得要用放大镜才看得见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..but you have to look under a magnifying glass to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.42,0:48:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子,很多玩具都有空军的编号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid, a lot of toys have "Air Force" written on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.66,0:48:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是征兵办公室,我们不管这些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a recruiting office. We don't handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.86,0:48:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我能告诉你芯片编号,你找人替我查查吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I give you the chip number to give to the right guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.10,0:48:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我们要告诉妈妈芯片的事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think we should tell Mom about the chip?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.81,0:48:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对,大人知道得越少越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you're right. The less they know, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.38,0:48:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those guys are bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.65,0:49:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢你用车撞我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you how much I appreciate you hitting me with the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.06,0:49:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别义气用事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never let emotions get the best of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.03,0:49:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你该提高警觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have been more vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.66,0:49:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你该去上驾驶课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have taken driver's ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.30,0:49:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是小孩,一定是小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a kid. It has to be a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.33,0:49:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我老了膝盖痛,全怪杰尼根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna have bad knees when I'm old. I'll have Jernigan to thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.64,0:49:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,警察来了两次,他们不相信那孩子..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cops come twice, they don't believe him..
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.07,0:49:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他自己调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..he takes matters into his own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.31,0:49:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没有别的可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.21,0:49:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,果真如此,我说我们没其他办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's the case, I say take no chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.58,0:49:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,明天,把附近小孩全杀了.干掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, whack every kid in the neighborhood. Burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.39,0:49:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再找玩具车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then look for that stupid car.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.85,0:49:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直觉得3026号有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My thoughts keep turning to number 3026.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.26,0:49:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具车在那附近打转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's within the operating radius of the toy car.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.33,0:49:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那里能看到所有的屋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in sight of all the houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.85,0:50:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 你拿到芯片了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Do you have the missile chip?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.42,0:50:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,快到手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are close.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.85,0:50:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果24小时内没拿到的话,博普雷先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't have the chip in 24 hours, Mr.Beaupre..
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.69,0:50:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我将中止行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..I will have to terminate the mission..
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.29,0:50:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,除掉所有参与行动的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..and nullify all the participants.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.13,0:50:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.23,0:50:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸明晚回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad's home tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.03,0:50:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我12点到5点要开会,所以我要你和莫莉..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have my meeting from 12 till 5, so I need you and Molly..
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.57,0:50:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们放学后直接回家陪艾历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..to come straight home after school to stay with Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.44,0:50:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不行,不可能.我有体操课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. No way. Impossible. I have gymnastics.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.61,0:50:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要打曲棍球 - 要我再说一次吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have hockey. - Do I need to repeat myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.14,0:50:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你可以找赫斯太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were getting Mrs.Hess.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.45,0:50:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对,她比我和斯坦有责任感多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, she's a lot more responsible than me and Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.55,0:50:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,赫斯太太是后备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs.Hess is a backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.82,0:50:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,除非有急事,我真的不想打扰她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless it's an emergency, I really don't want to call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.29,0:50:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我会照顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be fine by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.39,0:50:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,问题解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you have it. Settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.63,0:50:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,请传"假案"给我好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, could you pass me the false alarms?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.90,0:50:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起.抱歉,我是说给我豆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Sorry, I meant the peas.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.80,0:50:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.06,0:50:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.90,0:51:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对.他出水痘呆在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. He's been home with the chickenpox.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.61,0:51:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,艾历克斯,你认识布拉德利·克洛维斯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, do you know a Bradley Clovis?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.08,0:51:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.28,0:51:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是他妈妈.你拿了他的玩具车吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's his mom. Did you take a toy car from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.08,0:51:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他有摇控车,但那是邻居送的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has one of those cars, but he got it from a neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.09,0:51:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.13,0:51:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,艾历克斯,你干什么?你不能挂断我电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, what is the matter with you? You don't disconnect my calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.03,0:51:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不要跟克洛维斯太太谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to Mrs.Clovis.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.97,0:51:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么? - 她很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not? - She's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.30,0:51:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在说些什么? - 她说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - It was lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.44,0:51:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,全是谎话.那不是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all lies. It wasn't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.37,0:51:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思,那不是她?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, it wasn't her?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.61,0:51:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,打给她,你会吓一跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call her, you'll be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.53,0:51:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,打出电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outgoing call.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.47,0:52:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,转接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rerouted.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.54,0:52:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你好,克洛维斯家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Clovis'.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.07,0:52:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉,我们.. - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I beg your pardon. We just.. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.67,0:52:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我挂断了你电话,凯伦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I disconnect you, Karen?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.48,0:52:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不,是我.我们家里装修,电话线失常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it was me. We're renovating, the phone lines are a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.01,0:52:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拦截电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They intercepted the phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.82,0:52:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,听着,我不是指控你儿子偷东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I didn't mean to accuse your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.05,0:52:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是布拉德利把玩具车乱放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm certain Bradley just misplaced his toy car.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.16,0:52:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小孩子,他们找不到就以为被偷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids. They lose something and assume it's been stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.16,0:52:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,小男孩想像力丰富,对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little boys do have wild imaginations, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.70,0:52:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.71,0:52:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们明天会来抓我,多丽丝.没人相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna come after me tomorrow, Doris. Nobody will listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.62,0:52:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,无论我父母或者莫莉或者斯坦..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not my parents or Molly or Stan..
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.19,0:53:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,或者警察还是空军.没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..or the police or the Air Force. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那,我怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.49,0:53:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要我躲起来?不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that means hide, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.90,0:53:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,要我反击?对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that means fight, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.60,0:53:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我捉到他们时,大人就明白,知道我说的是真话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll understand when I'm done, and know I was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.64,0:53:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会哭,难过或害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna cry of feel sad or scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.28,0:53:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是成年罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're grown-up criminals..
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.38,0:53:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是我地盘,这是我的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..but this is my neighborhood and this is my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.08,0:53:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不管他们多大,多强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter how old they are, no matter how big they are..
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.65,0:53:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,都不能在这里打倒我.他们不能在我家打倒我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..they can't beat me here. They can't beat me at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.26,0:54:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要收买我闭嘴吗?两片,否则免谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want to buy a little silence? Double or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.25,0:54:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,(意大利粉肉酱)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.71,0:55:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,芝加哥地区将有大风雪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're watching a major storm bearing down on Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.98,0:55:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在雷达上,你可以看见风雪越来越大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the radar, you can see the snow is increasing in intensity.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.69,0:55:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,暴风雪预报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavy snow is forecasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.36,0:55:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,居民请尽可能留在家中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Residents are urged to stay indoors if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.12,0:55:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,接近目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approaching target.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.19,0:55:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.43,0:55:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,开战了,多丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go, Doris.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.00,0:56:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不,站住!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.38,0:56:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,首先,我们要释放人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, we free the hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.55,0:56:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,打开光纤摄影机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switching on the fiber optics.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.97,0:56:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,艾历克斯,你能去开下门吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, can you get the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.74,0:56:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没人应门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.42,0:56:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,目标人物真的没离开?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we certain target has not left?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.36,0:56:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We would've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我重覆,没人应门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, there is no movement inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.11,0:57:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,能否进去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.66,0:57:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.67,0:57:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,回家去.回家去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Go home. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.65,0:58:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要支援.我曝光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need assistance. I'm exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.59,0:58:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,留在原处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maintain your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.13,0:58:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不要,我重覆,别轻举妄动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not, I repeat, do not draw attention to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.40,0:58:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,去接她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.00,0:58:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等暴风雪降临再来,让风雪遮掩我们行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll move in after the storm hits, let Mother Nature cover our tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.01,0:58:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,刚从空军那里收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This just came in from the Air Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.78,0:58:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有个叫普鲁伊特的小孩联络芝加哥招聘中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kid named Pruitt called the recruiting office in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.58,0:58:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,说他在玩具车中找到芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said he found a computer chip in a toy car.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.02,0:58:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去芝加哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.22,0:58:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你看了气象预报吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you watch the weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.03,0:58:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的.没问题,外套在那里 - 谢谢,我要穿咖啡色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. No problems. Your coat's there. - Thanks. I want to wear my brown one.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.53,0:58:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,等等!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.06,0:58:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不如你去泡一杯咖啡,我帮你拿外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go fill your commuter cup with coffee and I'll get your coat for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.40,0:58:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.10,0:58:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你做三明治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make you a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.29,0:59:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的外套 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here's your coat. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.66,0:59:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的,这星期很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart, I'm sorry about this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.26,0:59:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,忙忙碌碌的真不开心.不该这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It breaks my heart to have to come and go. It shouldn't be this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.43,0:59:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系,不关你的事.身不由己而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. It's not you. It's the times.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.50,0:59:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.81,0:59:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你有传呼机?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have your beeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.88,0:59:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.91,0:59:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,很好.每半小时联络一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. I'll call every half-hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.68,0:59:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,整天都会跟你保持联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go online and keep the connection open all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.18,0:59:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,开会时也带着手提电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have my laptop in all my meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.12,0:59:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们随时保持联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be in contact at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.12,0:59:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我带着移动电话,你有我的传真号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have my cellular. You've got my fax number.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.96,0:59:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们保持连线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're wired.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.93,0:59:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,我的天啊.克洛维斯太太来过电话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my gosh. Did Mrs.Clovis call?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.93,0:59:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她说要看车是不是布拉德利的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was gonna stop by to confirm that Bradley's name wasn't on the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.97,0:59:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你洗澡时她来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did when you were in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.17,0:59:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你给她看了? - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You let her have it? - Bigtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.71,0:59:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我希望她觉得自己很蠢 - 非常难堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hope she felt foolish. - It was painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.28,1:00:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好了,乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.71,1:00:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要小心.好好看家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be safe. Keep an eye on the old place.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.15,1:00:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,包在我身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it all covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.66,1:00:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,作好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.93,1:00:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只靠你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.60,1:01:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说难道还有别人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean there's someone else?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.54,1:01:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,作战开始!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready to rumble! Play ball!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.75,1:01:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,(游泳池)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.58,1:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(弹床)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.46,1:02:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,防不胜防\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old switcheroo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.97,1:02:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来啊 - 大显身手的时间到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.68,1:02:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那要是真的,我就是老鹰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If those are real, I'm an eagle.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.85,1:02:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.38,1:02:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 嗨,我是凯伦·普鲁伊特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - Hi, it's Karen Pruitt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.78,1:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,您能帮我去看看艾历克斯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you check on Alex for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.85,1:02:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just going out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.95,1:02:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我在上班脱不开身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm at work and in a bind.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.12,1:03:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,呃,多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how long?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.46,1:03:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不超过一小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wouldn't be for more than an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.39,1:03:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好,不包括煮饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. No cooking.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.74,1:03:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,找赫斯太太..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Call Mrs.Hess.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.18,1:03:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,她退休了,在家还能有什么事干?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's retired, what else could she possibly be doing?"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.17,1:03:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,临时保姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babysitter!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.55,1:03:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他们过节时邀请过我?当然没有!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would they invite me to their house for holiday eggnog? Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.55,1:03:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看谁出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who woke up from her nap.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.93,1:03:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,坏蛋距离30码,正走过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crooks at 30 yards and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.60,1:03:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏上场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the party begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.24,1:03:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,下午好,我们刚搬来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon. We just moved into your neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.07,1:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,想要什么,钮扣吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want, a button?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.87,1:03:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有一个包裹,但司机搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A package was to be delivered to us, but the driver got confuse,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.62,1:03:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可能送到了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}perhaps he brought it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.21,1:03:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不,这儿没有任何东西送来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope, they didn't bring anything here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.78,1:04:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快递公司说没人应门包裹留在车房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The delivered company said no one answered the door and the driver left it in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有时他们将包裹放在后门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes they leave stuff at the back door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.94,1:04:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你为何关门?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you closing the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.38,1:04:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我将面包留在三藩市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left my heart in San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.75,1:04:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼将屋子关得密不透风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like he has the place locked up pretty tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.92,1:04:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,(危险有电 小心)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.01,1:05:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,杰尼根,一定很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jernigan, I think I'm going to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.95,1:05:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没玩过小孩子的玩意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long time since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.28,1:05:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快忘了小孩子有多蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forget how incredibly stupid they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.82,1:05:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.59,1:05:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小孩子害怕时,他们会尿裤子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When kids get scared, they wet their pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.46,1:05:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,昂格尔先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Unger?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.11,1:06:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.57,1:06:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,昂格尔先生,你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Unger, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.28,1:06:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰那些线,有电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch the yarn. It's wired.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.91,1:06:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那小孩到处布设陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid's got the place booby-trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.25,1:06:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别大意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make no assumptions.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.72,1:06:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,小心垫子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch the mat.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.56,1:06:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子很聪明,你试过开门吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This boy is clever. Have you tried the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.56,1:06:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.09,1:07:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你仔细看好我给你提示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me point something out to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.63,1:07:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我没留意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missed that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.10,1:07:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别走近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.05,1:07:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他不是那么聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's not so clever after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.05,1:07:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对,今天表现失常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think we're just having an off day.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.00,1:07:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,给你一个忠告..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thought for you to consider:
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.51,1:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,通过机场时..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At airport security..
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.41,1:07:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别拿错行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..make sure you have the right package.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.65,1:08:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你不会..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I certainly hope that you're not..
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.12,1:08:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢对街那个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..fond of that little boy across the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.70,1:08:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我会开着门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll leave this open.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.27,1:08:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,新鲜空气对你有益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh air will be good for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.18,1:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,自以为很聪明?你个小鬼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you're smart? You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.52,1:08:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,昂格尔,情况如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unger, what's your status?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.61,1:09:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,抬头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.84,1:09:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事? - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd that happen? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.79,1:09:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哎哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.53,1:09:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们被书砸中?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got hit with a book?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.63,1:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,书,好多书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Books. Plural.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.37,1:09:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一大箱的书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A trunk full of books..
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.70,1:09:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,接着是哑呤,我连中两次,你个笨女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..then a set of weights. I got hit twice, you dumb broad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.21,1:10:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起,昂格尔先生.我不会给那孩子吓怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Mr.Unger. I didn't get taken down by an infant.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.41,1:10:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想不到他会反击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't anticipate the defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.45,1:10:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我由正面进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go in the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.15,1:10:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,昂格尔先生,你由北面进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Unger, you take the north side.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.95,1:10:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝,你由南面进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice, you take the south side.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.72,1:10:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,杰尼根先生在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Mr.Jernigan?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.01,1:10:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意,旅客们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, travelers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.51,1:10:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所有前往芝加哥的航班因风雪暂停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All flights to Chicago continue to be delayed due to severe weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.25,1:10:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,请等待进一步通知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please stand by for further details.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.71,1:11:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,(祝君快乐)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.54,1:11:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(强力地板胶)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.25,1:11:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑得掉但躲不掉,小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can run but you can't hide, junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.42,1:11:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.53,1:12:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.94,1:13:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,找到他了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.55,1:14:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你死定了,小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are dead, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.47,1:15:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,事有转机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now things are looking up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.95,1:15:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,逮到你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.38,1:15:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.84,1:16:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,喔,喔,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.12,1:16:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,想整我没那么容易,小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice try, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.75,1:17:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.06,1:17:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming down.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.13,1:18:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,杰尼根先生!昂格尔先生!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Jernigan! Mr.Unger!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.10,1:18:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.30,1:18:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你剪了头发?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a haircut?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.31,1:18:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you almost done in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.58,1:18:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,别来惹我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't start with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.09,1:18:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.17,1:18:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.18,1:18:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么臭味? - 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What stinks? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.58,1:19:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.69,1:19:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你上气不接下气,有什么事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of breath. Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.69,1:19:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.59,1:19:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我好担心,天气很坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so worried. The weather is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.86,1:19:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna come home now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.70,1:19:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不,不,别急,真的.不用赶回来,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, take your time, really. Don't come home, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.34,1:19:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈,你先去学校接斯坦和莫莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick up Stan and Molly from school.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.67,1:19:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.21,1:19:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯,我在跟赫斯太太下中国象棋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm playing Chinese checkers with Mrs.Hess.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.44,1:19:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你没吸烟吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not smoking?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.98,1:19:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没有.我得走了,赫斯太太不喜欢等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I gotta go. Mrs.Hess gets nutty when you make her wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.68,1:19:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好,别耍赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, play fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.38,1:19:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.65,1:19:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,勇敢的小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a brave little fellow.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.53,1:19:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,杰尼根先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Jernigan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.73,1:19:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 客厅没有人 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Living room clear. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.20,1:19:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,厨房什么也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.21,1:20:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,杰尼根先生,跟着我,慢点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Jernigan, follow me. Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.68,1:20:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,去,多丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Doris.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.56,1:20:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,昂格尔先生,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Unger, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.00,1:20:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,掩护他,我监视楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover him, I'll cover the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.50,1:20:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我来找你了,小矮子,来找你报仇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming for you, shorty, to pay you back..
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.41,1:20:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你给我受的罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..for all the misery you caused me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.91,1:20:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,昂格尔先生,你干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Unger, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.51,1:20:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子在衣橱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid's in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.05,1:20:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在我捉他前,先吓吓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scaring him a little, just before I grab him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.92,1:20:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看谁在门后面!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And behind door number one!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.23,1:20:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,毛巾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Towels.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.73,1:20:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到门关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw this door close.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.43,1:20:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.13,1:21:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我会撒谎吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would I make it up?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.80,1:21:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?有意思吗?我们有佣金吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? What's the point? We working on commission here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.31,1:21:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.34,1:21:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 华盛顿街的普鲁伊特太太? - 怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mrs.Pruitt from Washington Street? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.68,1:21:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔基探员,联邦调查局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Stuckey, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.31,1:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我来找你儿子谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came to talk to your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.95,1:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你打电话给空军说遥控车内有电脑芯片?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You called about a computer chip in a remote-control car?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.65,1:21:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.69,1:21:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,天啊,是艾历克斯.是我另一个儿子.发生什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. It's Alex. It's my other son. What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.63,1:22:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He may be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.26,1:22:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在这里,他在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not here. He's at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.60,1:22:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.77,1:22:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,为何他有危险?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is he in danger?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.04,1:22:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她问你问题,先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She asked you a question, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.71,1:22:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不方便谈,孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not at liberty to discuss it, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.81,1:22:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的人是我小弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "it" you're referring to is my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.62,1:22:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相信他取得了一个机密电脑芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thing he intercepted a top-secret electronic device..
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.16,1:22:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是被从防御部门偷走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..stolen from a Defense Dept. Contractor..
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.36,1:22:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,罪犯替北朝鲜恐怖组织工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..by criminals working for a North Korean terrorist organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.75,1:22:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,杰尼根先生,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Jernigan, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.10,1:23:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,绿眼女郎,海的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green-eyed lady, ocean lady
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.00,1:23:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,踏浪而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving every breaking wave that comes
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.71,1:23:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,上,多丽丝,上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Doris, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.03,1:23:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,绿眼女郎,海的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green-eyed lady, ocean lady
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.87,1:23:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,踏浪而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving every breaking wave that comes
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.24,1:23:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,绿眼女郎,海的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green-eyed lady, lovely lady
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.47,1:23:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,迎着阳光漫步而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strolling slowly towards the sun
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.41,1:24:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉,查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.98,1:24:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天运气不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This just ain't your day.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.53,1:24:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.10,1:24:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.50,1:24:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.77,1:24:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't..
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.44,1:24:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,..动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..move.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.21,1:24:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.45,1:24:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干嘛?爱丽丝? - 嘘!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? Alice? - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.00,1:24:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.26,1:24:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.89,1:24:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃,小矮子,快逃!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, shorty, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.19,1:24:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,快,多丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Doris.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.76,1:24:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那小子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.20,1:24:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,多丽丝,快来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doris, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.07,1:24:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,死小子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.40,1:24:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我捉到他了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.45,1:25:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你打我要害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You smacked my winkie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.55,1:25:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你常换内裤,也许就不会有老鼠!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you changed your shorts, maybe you wouldn't have rats in your pants!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.66,1:25:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scraggy little rug rat!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.45,1:25:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.45,1:25:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,留在这里,多丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here, Doris.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.76,1:25:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.08,1:26:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,发射!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.35,1:26:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直在监视我们.他用摄像机监视我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been watching us the whole time. He had a camera on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.12,1:26:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那里找不到我,你个大笨蛋,无法无天的蠢货!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't find me up there, you big, dumb, law-breaking knuckleheads!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.56,1:26:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.40,1:26:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,认得这个吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognize this?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.47,1:26:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么出去的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd he get outside?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.37,1:26:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也一样出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same way you will get outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.17,1:26:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,跳!快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.48,1:26:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't push.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.58,1:26:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是弹床.你跳到弹床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a trampoline. You're jumping onto a trampoline.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.08,1:26:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你不跟我们一起跳吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I presume you won't be joining us?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.15,1:26:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不,我在这里掩护你们,快! - 真让人安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I'll be covering you. Go! - How comforting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.09,1:26:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他要逃了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.09,1:26:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,小菜一碟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a snap.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.39,1:26:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,小菜一碟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a snap.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.76,1:27:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,跳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.55,1:27:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,冷.非常冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold. Very cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.54,1:27:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,(阁楼)
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.87,1:27:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.41,1:27:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了,小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I come, you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.36,1:28:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哎哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.73,1:28:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,赫斯太太!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs.Hess!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.64,1:28:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,赫斯太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs.Hess.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.38,1:28:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,赫斯太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs.Hess.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.45,1:28:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay. I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.48,1:29:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,呃..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well..
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.28,1:29:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是艾历克斯,对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..it's Alex, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.89,1:29:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你要学到..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today you learn something.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.36,1:29:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,当好市民要付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a price to be paid for being a good citizen.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.13,1:29:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你的热忱想救邻居,而掉入我的陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your zeal to aid your neighbor, you stepped into one of my traps.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.08,1:29:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,芯片不在这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chip's not here!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.71,1:29:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,能让赫斯太太进屋去吗?她很老又很冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can Mrs.Hess go inside? She's very old and very cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.06,1:29:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.33,1:29:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,给我芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.07,1:29:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,芯片不属于你,不是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't belong to you. It's not yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.24,1:30:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,芯片,小子.给我芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chip, son. Give me the chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.28,1:30:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那也不属于你 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That doesn't belong to you either. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.55,1:30:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是你的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not your gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.12,1:30:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是你的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.30,1:30:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,骗到你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.91,1:30:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来,坐下,赫斯太太 - 谢谢你,艾历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here, sit down, Mrs.Hess. - Thank you, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.75,1:30:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该喝碗汤,喜欢什么汤?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are times that call for soup. Any favorites?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.22,1:30:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢,不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.82,1:30:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道,赫斯太太..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Mrs.Hess..
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.55,1:30:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,外面真的很冷.对老人来说你真壮健\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..it's really cold outside. You're a pretty tough old bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.06,1:30:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个细心的好孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're a very sweet young man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.50,1:31:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前从没留意到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just never took the time to notice.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.10,1:31:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不只你没留意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not alone in that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.95,1:31:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰逊,威廉姆斯,到后面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnson, Williams. Go around back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.69,1:32:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.63,1:32:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么动?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.84,1:32:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,艾历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.55,1:32:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.00,1:32:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你当着警察的面抱我还亲我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hugging and kissing me in front of the cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.11,1:32:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.51,1:32:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真抱歉我没相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry I didn't listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.21,1:32:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,精采\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is very cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.95,1:32:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计,你真个英雄了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bud, you're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.62,1:33:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是艾历克斯? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you Alex? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.85,1:33:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔基探员,联邦调查局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Stuckey, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.89,1:33:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,芯片在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.79,1:33:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,街对面有个长者..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a senior citizen across the street..
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.46,1:33:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要热汤和医生去看看她的脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..who needs some soup and a doctor to look at her feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.53,1:33:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,游泳池有两个家伙,地下室有个女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's two guys in our pool and a woman in our basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.77,1:33:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other one's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.08,1:33:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this him?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.05,1:33:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.28,1:33:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我追捕这家伙七年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven years, I've been after this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.99,1:33:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,每次都让他逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He always manages to slip away.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.39,1:33:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.83,1:33:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只有这三个人 - 你们老大在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's just the three. - Where's your boss?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.67,1:33:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把他们带走! - 是,长官.走吧,冰棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get them out of here! - Yes, sir. Let's go, popsicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.94,1:33:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.95,1:34:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,露西,我回家了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucy, I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.26,1:34:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你打什么主意,猴子屁股?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on your mind, monkey butt?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.33,1:34:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,坏,坏,勒罗伊·布朗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad, bad, Leroy Brown.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.27,1:34:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,休士顿,出了问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Houston, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.71,1:34:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,倒数..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Counting down in..
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.11,1:34:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,..5,4,3,2..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..five, four, three, two..
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.02,1:34:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.55,1:34:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,两片,否则免谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.39,1:34:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有一片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only have one.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.62,1:34:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,点火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have ignition.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.83,1:34:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,表演时间!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.98,1:35:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我一会儿就到.好,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be there in just a minute. Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.52,1:35:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,门前没铲雪的中古型房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Tudor with the Christmas lights in the driveway..
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.92,1:35:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那一家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..that hasn't been shoveled.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.19,1:35:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那家,就那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one, right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.37,1:35:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你长过水痘吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever had the chickenpox?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.54,1:35:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我长水痘时赫伯特·胡佛还在白宫呢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had the chickenpox when Herbert Hoover was in the White House.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.34,1:35:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.91,1:35:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.58,1:35:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.02,1:35:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看.你看来还很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see. You don't look any worse for the wear.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.46,1:35:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们斗不过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They couldn't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.23,1:35:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑公司送给艾历克斯奖金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The computer company with the boosted chip is giving Alex a reward.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.80,1:35:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有六位数的奖金,利害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a six-figure sum, which is extremely cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.23,1:36:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那你有礼物给我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So did you bring me anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.64,1:36:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.67,1:36:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.31,1:36:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你会遥控吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you can drive that?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.08,1:36:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我想没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.71,1:36:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们,发动引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, start your engines.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.45,1:36:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,360度回转!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}360! 360!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.82,1:36:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,老鼠坠车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rat overboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.23,1:36:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,笑一笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say cheese.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.63,1:37:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.62,1:37:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,
